    "body": "Proves the historical k605,a (published k606; v1 k604) signed product of the two original-focus pedal areas of the OUTER tangent polygon, for every odd least-period strict confocal elliptical-caustic family, all coprime stars/N3 and fixed repetitions. Author turn1/5 and all20 original artifacts retained. Exact N4 counterexamples delimit the primitive-even boundary.\n\nExplicit focal-foot geometry, adjacent collinear residue cancellation, reflection and classical complementary torus divisor proof. Stachel/Jacobi/auxiliary-circle and cyclic elliptic/area methods, the exact Khare\u2013Sukhatme2004 analytic identity and related Ferudun results receive substantive credit, with complete geometric comparison bridges. Historical novelty/public priority remain undetermined; no first-proof/new-general-method/current-worldwide-open claim. Source-access limits and related-source fixture correction remain explicit.\n\nIndependent mathematical/source reconstruction, full reproduction, extensive bounded priority audit and required NEW sequential whole-package adversaries/global repairs completed. Exact controls and labelled uncertified numerical diagnostics accompany the note. Extensive AI use; unrefereed, no independent human peer review or formal proof-assistant verification.\n\nPreprint and verification: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23398175. Single GWS append/all4cells verified at 'Math Puzzles'!A113:D113.",
